{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Voice.</b> Watchers who exist, and all of them lift their voice for your herald." "<b>For eye to eye.</b> For all of them see with eyes, that YHWH has returned to Zion. And like it: \"which eye to eye You were seen, YHWH\" (Numbers 14:14)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 52, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:09.418851820Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}